    61	        # M-RoPE (multimodal rotary). The 3 sections (T, H, W) sum to rope_head_dim // 2 and drive
    62	        # the interleaved-mrope cos/sin (modeling_qwen3_5.Qwen3_5RotaryEmbedding). For the "default"
    63	        # rope type Qwen3.5 uses, attention_scaling is 1.0 (so text cos/sin are unchanged). The
    64	        # spatial_merge_size + image/video token ids let the model derive the 3D position ids on
    65	        # host from input_ids + image_grid_thw (no dependency on mm_token_type_ids from the caller).
