    89	
    90	        # MTP (multi-token prediction) head. Every Qwen3.5/3.6 checkpoint ships a single-layer
    91	        # MTP head (mtp.*) that reuses the main embedding + LM head; it is the speculative-decode
    92	        # drafter. mtp_use_dedicated_embeddings=False means it shares tok_embeddings.
    93	        # Loading the head is ON by default for dense checkpoints that ship one (it is the production
