   343	    def is_distributed_norm(self, mode):
   344	        """Force the distributed-norm path for multi-device MoE prefill.
   345	
   346	        The prefill norm-all-gather fusion (all_gather_minimal_matmul_async in-proj) needs the norm
   347	        to honor enable_all_gather and leave its output hidden-fractured for the fused matmul to
   348	        gather. The base enables the distributed-norm path only for dim>4096 (an L1 heuristic the
   349	        dense 27B's 5120 hits but the MoE 35B-A3B's 2048 misses) — on the miss it force-gathers the
   350	        norm output, so the AGMM in-proj double-gathers (K mismatch). Only the MoE configs need this
   351	        override (dense variants either hit the dim>4096 heuristic like the 27B, or are validated on
   352	        the base path), so gate it on moe_num_experts to avoid diverging the dense path from base.
