   259	    # Chunk-parallel prefill via the C++ gated_delta_attn_seq kernel (float32) is
   260	    # the default prefill path. The kernel hardcodes Ct=4 diagonal blocks, so it
   261	    # ONLY supports chunk_size=128 (= long_prefill_chunk_size). Precompute its
