codex
The source confirms that every GDN prefill enters the host-created FIR selector path, even for fully aligned input. I also found a separate correctness concern: the inherited chunk scan defaults to diagonal damping that changes the reference recurrence. I’m checking the lowered operation and reference math before ranking that finding.
