    68	    tt_transformers reference (model_config.py:1433). For chunk_start_idx > 0,
    69	    chunk sizes must divide chunk_start_idx (uses lowest-set-bit trick).
    70	    For decode with pre-allocated cache (q_seq_len=1), use small chunks.
    71	    For segmented prefill (q_seq_len < seq_len, both > 1), use small chunks.
    72	    For regular prefill, scale chunks based on seq_len.
