    68	    # the N-gridded core count is 32 (vs 8 for the old intermediate-parallel N=256). M is one
    69	    # 32-row tile per group (group_size folded into the sparse batch dim), per_core_M stays 1.
    70	    # down: M is the full chunk_len, so its per_core_M reflects the real M (= chunk_len/32).
    71	    gate_up_config = _build_sparse_matmul_config(TILE_SIZE, 2 * intermediate_size)
