+- Example BF16 checkpoint shapes: GDN QKV `[8192,2048]`, convolution `[8192,1,4]`, experts gate/up `[256,1024,2048]`, experts down `[256,2048,512]`, full-attention Q/gate `[8192,2048]`, K `[512,2048]`.
